    SnapshotTestTool &middot; <a href="https://testsearch.example.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="report-meta-url">https://testsearch.example.com</a> &middot; Evaluated 2025-06-15 10:00
  </div>
  <dl class="report-meta">
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    <dt class="report-meta-label">AI-powered</dt><dd class="report-meta-value report-meta-value--muted">Yes</dd>
    
